<h2 id="booking">Our business and your booking</h2>
<p>Professor Jerry RV is a brand operated by Malcolm Enterprises LLC. These terms describe our website and services, including RV training, walkthroughs, consulting, maintenance, concierge services, and inspections.</p>
<p>Before you book, we will confirm the requested service, scope, price, location or online meeting arrangements, and scheduling details. A contact-form submission alone does not confirm an appointment. Any service-specific agreement provided and accepted before booking governs that service where its terms differ from this page. We will make these terms available before payment.</p>

<h2 id="pricing-and-payment">Pricing and payment</h2>
<p>Website prices are in U.S. dollars and may change. We will confirm your total, including applicable taxes, trip charges, parts, and other fees, before you book. Changes to published prices do not change a previously accepted quote unless you approve a change in scope or another adjustment.</p>
<p>Services and inspections require payment before the scheduled service unless we agree otherwise in writing. Your invoice identifies the amount and payment due date. If payment is not received as agreed, we will contact you about rescheduling or cancellation.</p>
<p>Online payments are processed through Stripe. Please use the secure payment link provided with your invoice; do not send card details by email or through the website contact form. Additional work, parts, or charges require your approval before we proceed.</p>

<h2 id="discounts">Discounts and promotions</h2>
<p>Promotional discounts apply only to the eligible services and dates stated in the offer. The Grand Opening Sale offers 20% off eligible services through December 31, 2026; see each offering for details. Veterans and first responders receive an ongoing 10% discount from regular service prices. Discounts cannot be combined. Where the Grand Opening discount applies, it is used on its own; the ongoing veterans and first responders discount remains available after the sale ends. Mention your eligibility when booking so we can confirm the correct invoice total.</p>
